<title>PHILIPPINES: Metro Pacific declares six ctv cash div.</title>
<headline>Metro Pacific declares six ctv cash div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Holding company Metro Pacific Corp said on Monday its board had declared a six centavo cash dividend to be given to shareholders as of March 26.</p>
<p>Corporate secretary Antonio Picazo told the Philippine Stock Exchange the dividiend will be paid out of the retained earnings as of December 31.</p>
<p>Metro Pacific is the Philippine flagship company of First Pacific Co Ltd of Hong Kong.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
